<div class="content"><div class="pagehead"><div><div class="eyebrow">ABC College · Fictional client</div><h1 id="pageTitle">Assessment workspace</h1><div class="sub" id="pageSub">Choose a test to open its class review queue, or set up a new assessment.</div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" data-goto="setup">＋ &nbsp;Create assessment</button></div></div>
<div class="notice"><span>ⓘ</span><span><b>Demo only.</b> Student profiles and assessment marks load from the local SQLite demo database. All records are fictional. AI grading and feedback are simulated; no OCR or AI service is connected. Uploaded files remain in this browser.</span></div>

<section id="dashboard" class="view">
<div class="filters"><div class="filter"><label for="dashClass">Class</label><select id="dashClass"><option value="all">All classes</option><option value="BSC1">B.Sc. Biology · Year 1</option><option value="BSC2">B.Sc. Biology · Year 2</option></select></div><div class="filter"><label for="dashSection">Section</label><select id="dashSection"><option value="all">All sections</option><option value="A">Section A</option><option value="B">Section B</option></select></div><div class="filter"><label for="dashSubject">Subject</label><select id="dashSubject"><option value="all">All subjects</option><option value="BIO101">Introduction to Biology</option><option value="CHEM101">Chemistry Fundamentals</option><option value="ECO201">Ecology</option></select></div><div class="filter"><label for="dashTest">Test</label><select id="dashTest"><option value="all">All tests</option><option value="UT1">Unit Test 1</option><option value="UT2">Unit Test 2</option><option value="MID">Midterm</option><option value="SEM1">Semester 1 Exam</option></select></div><button class="btn" id="resetDash">Clear filters</button></div>
<div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="statline">Assessments<span class="staticon">▤</span></div><div class="statval" id="statAssessments">3</div><div class="statnote">Separate records for each test</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="statline">Student submissions<span class="staticon">♙</span></div><div class="statval" id="statSubmissions">8</div><div class="statnote">In current view</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="statline">Awaiting faculty review<span class="staticon">◷</span></div><div class="statval" id="statReview">5</div><div class="statnote">Provisional scores</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="statline">Feedback ready<span class="staticon">✓</span></div><div class="statval" id="statFeedback">3</div><div class="statnote">After faculty approval</div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="cardhead"><div><div class="cardtitle">Your assessments</div><div class="carddesc">Each row is one test. Open a test to see the class submission queue and faculty actions.</div></div><span class="tag">TEACHER VIEW</span></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Assessment / test</th><th>Class · section</th><th>Subject</th><th>Submissions</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="assessmentRows"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section id="setup" class="view" style="display:none"><div class="reviewhead"><div><h2>Create an assessment</h2><div class="carddesc">Set up the test and marking guide, then add the answer sheets for its class.</div></div><button class="btn" data-goto="dashboard">Cancel</button></div>
<div class="stepper" aria-label="Assessment setup flow"><div class="step active" data-step="1"><i>1</i> Test &amp; marking guide</div><div class="line"></div><div class="step" data-step="2"><i>2</i> Student PDFs</div><div class="line"></div><div class="step" data-step="3"><i>3</i> Confirm matches</div></div>
<div class="panel active" id="step1"><div class="card pad"><div class="sectiontitle">Test details</div><div class="grid2"><div class="field"><label for="testName">Assessment name</label><input id="testName" value="Unit Test 1 — Biology" placeholder="e.g. Unit Test 1"></div><div class="field"><label for="testType">Test type</label><select id="testType"><option value="UT1">Unit Test 1</option><option value="UT2">Unit Test 2</option><option value="MID">Midterm</option><option value="SEM1">Semester exam</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="setupClass">Class</label><select id="setupClass"><option value="BSC1">B.Sc. Biology · Year 1</option><option value="BSC2">B.Sc. Biology · Year 2</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="setupSection">Section</label><select id="setupSection"><option value="A">Section A</option><option value="B">Section B</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="setupSubject">Subject</label><select id="setupSubject"><option value="BIO101">Introduction to Biology</option><option value="CHEM101">Chemistry Fundamentals</option><option value="ECO201">Ecology</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="testDate">Test date</label><input id="testDate" type="date"></div></div>
